{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0263_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c27faa6fe2c46b7ec831e146dad5219db8ccf7ecb8220ddbdd89bb67cf314b2e", "ja": "（ツアーの告知のために、再び大阪に来ている。\n期間中は、何かと移動が多くなるな……）", "zh": "（为了宣传巡演，又来到了大阪。活动期间要经常到处奔波呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0263_1001_051tmg", "source_sha256": "754fdbf03dd6a6df3bf4533109d19c2bf0c1a7ba7482c496bcd24ac076a7070b", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさまです。\nちょっと相談があるのですが……よろしいですか？", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了。\n我有件事想和您商量一下……可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0263_1002_p", "source_sha256": "be442465b16a417cf8ccfa38fdad00acc5448ca7b9d49c826cf0365eda8cba55", "ja": "うん？　もちろんいいぞ！　どんな事だろう？", "zh": "嗯？当然可以！是什么事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0263_1003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "92310d01fa95417bba1f7597739337ba39b400b4fae3bbb298dff7acae3eb291", "ja": "では、早速……ボケてみてください。", "zh": "那么，马上就请你来个装傻吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0263_1004_p", "source_sha256": "1fc4d2416c893f3bedffe2b8929d3d392e97a67e4d463aa53720ee37b7ceb836", "ja": "えっ！？　ボケてって……今ここでか！？\nちょっと待ってくれ、ええと……！", "zh": "诶！？让我装傻……现在就在这里吗！？\n等一下，让我想想……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0263_1005_051tmg", "source_sha256": "554a9f0a45048edc7bf40f2f92a42fa00a61e238e0a71ca00cc78956b6666686", "ja": "……。時間切れです。\n{$P$}、あなたは、もしや……。", "zh": "……。时间到了。\n{$P$}，您难道说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0263_1006_051tmg", "source_sha256": "306797483f9e4260f7116fd3b6c614f01c35099b96a0e92cf430fb20011527bc", "ja": "あまり、面白くない方なのですか？", "zh": "其实是个挺无趣的人吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0263_1007_p", "source_sha256": "de35b1740aad46d9954215af375ab229d2d04b32d90e0fb14cfb2af40bb97638", "ja": "い、いや……そうかもしれないけど！　\nいくら面白い人でも、急に振られたら難しいと思うぞ。", "zh": "不、不是……话是这么说啦！\n但就算再有趣的人，突然被抛梗也是很难接住的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0263_1008_051tmg", "source_sha256": "9729252a1e13fb934c4ec4716f6def83028bb52615607ea40928f216f5c42191", "ja": "なるほど、そういうものですか……。\n難しいのですね。ボケとツッコミ、というものは。", "zh": "原来如此，是这样的吗……\n很难啊。所谓装傻和吐槽，就是这么回事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0263_1009_p", "source_sha256": "c1a8160b9e69aae115056138698c5837921688e8e324fd50f897a020b9da5765", "ja": "まあ、そうだな……でも、どうして\nいきなり、ボケとかツッコミとか言い出したんだ？", "zh": "嗯，是啊……不过，你为什么突然提起装傻和吐槽了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0263_1010_051tmg", "source_sha256": "332fa8c90920077fb3c6fbd68dc4d6288368e9b660dec00b1bd65cb7f72aed46", "ja": "自分でも、わかっていますが……。\n私は、どうにもつまらない人間です。", "zh": "我自己也明白……我实在是个很无趣的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0263_1011_051tmg", "source_sha256": "058de4bd2760e909061c7e688e446e1d78f85c6d37a43cb9d7aa97034adf63dc", "ja": "でも、せっかくツアーの告知を任されたのですから、\n大阪の皆さんに喜んでいただきたい、と……。", "zh": "不过，难得有机会负责巡演宣传，我还是希望能让大阪的各位开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0263_1012_051tmg", "source_sha256": "bafdb9ed9968866f882be3952a5082850e5ca49ded6fcefe4d4502ad7cd689b4", "ja": "私も、変わりたいと思ったのです。\n皆さんのように、自分の殻を破って……。", "zh": "我也想要改变自己。像大家一样，突破自己的心墙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0263_1013_p", "source_sha256": "bd79d54e1cc4c66d77387f33b531770cf077938e67d362b9cea5c373e5e7f171", "ja": "そうか……うん、その気持ちは大切だな！\nでも、別に焦る必要はないんじゃないか？", "zh": "这样啊……嗯，这份心情很珍贵！\n不过，也没必要急于求成吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0263_1014_p", "source_sha256": "fc698a0a67dbf9f9614ea98cc92ab0d2c729f0b2d982cbde4893197b7158cf00", "ja": "まず大前提からだけど、\n紬は、つまらなくはないと思うんだよな。", "zh": "先从最基本的说起吧，我觉得紬并不是无聊的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0263_1015_051tmg", "source_sha256": "7f9d63c8b581f44d85e483a655904136944693adcd6c838cadcd200c7d931c32", "ja": "えっ？　あの、それはどういう……。\nはっ。まさか……無様すぎて笑える、と……？", "zh": "诶？那个，你这是什么意思……  \n啊。难道是……因为太狼狈了，反而很可笑……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0263_1016_p", "source_sha256": "6f5915c6bedbe70eed9f0f43868ff3c396b00e537e3ab918193930e2cd2b8a70", "ja": "ち、違う違う！　ま、まあとにかく、\n今日のところは、自由にトークしてきてくれ。", "zh": "不、不对不对！总、总之，今天就先自由聊聊吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0263_1017_p", "source_sha256": "406ab3b54e6fe0d0f1bb6e9fd41cb3ea9eb41937381be5d0df270071a0f3b834", "ja": "急に紬のキャラが変わると、\nファンのみんなも戸惑うと思うよ。", "zh": "要是紬的性格突然变了，\n粉丝们也会感到困惑的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0263_1018_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ae6c71af280506cef4133cd00f5391985c4c9d715ba6befea51444c5967209fb", "ja": "なるほど……確かにそうですね。わかりました。\nでは、ツッコミの練習は追々に。", "zh": "原来如此……确实是这样。明白了。\n那么，吐槽的练习就以后再说吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0263_1019_051tmg", "source_sha256": "9ca8b510cfe382f5ff9481367d38b8b20b2db9cb2f7f0381098247b5e5213632", "ja": "あなたも、ボケの練習をしておいてください。\nよろしくお願いいたします。", "zh": "你也请练习一下装傻。\n拜托您了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
